<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-25T06:31:57.762Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 06:31:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Taliban forces are confronting Pakistani security troops along the Kurram border, while Pakistan has halted trade at two Iran crossings and a dispute over the Zangali checkpost is affecting Torkham operations as it deepens a defence pact with Saudi Arabia and Turkey. The United Nations warns Afghanistan is one step away from famine and the Taliban has opened a road to China that faces security hurdles. Iran remains open to US talks under a Pakistan-brokered deal and a new opium-related hub is emerging in Afghan borderlands with Iran and Pakistan after the Taliban ban. 1,794 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168631&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1PZnRNalNoVnZlbmxaMFRfYWUzRFVGclR4dHNwVE1Ed0RTUFNkVF9mYllYWndQNEVySzNicE1vRW9wTFVsS18tMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1UbDZSUXV2d2ZJVnVZNzA3Z3pWb2x3UEVGQ3lvV2VpakcxVFR1VGw2UUNCeEJOajF4WjJJbi00VnE3Tkp6ZEE4Uw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNTUpXRUkwMldIUlpBTTRDSWJtWnI2RWM5cW96WEpWSFZGRV85bmJaNjJvak5NUlE0TFVJWi1YMy1VUXdiaFFiUUhIc19SZm53Y3A3bWRjbFhsR05BZTJZY1ZWTGtQVXRERnc3allzdmxST2VkVjFxcG9wNU5FNkVnX3A3REtwSW1kdEx2RmdYa2d0aEZLNjBnTGtpekhOMF9VcTFlZW16TTI4bUU5anhOSTU5LU5rVTJ2Y182OVJvZmhQSmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE03MV85N09fZWhPM2p6TDJsMlhwOHpaNXZZNHRMQnU4TzJ2TENlaTBtWTd3c0VVTnBuREpiQ1U4UHJ1eEdHNk1JUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5